60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"We have three clear options: the Hot Spring Town, the Island Trip, or the City Break. Given our discussions, the Hot Spring Town seems to balance our needs for togetherness and predictability.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The Hot Spring Town seems to offer a lovely balance of shared experience and a structured cost that keeps things fair for everyone.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"I'm still a little nervous about the shared room, but the Hot Spring Town sounds like a peaceful choice that won't be too tiring.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The Hot Spring Town is definitely the most reasonable choice for me; the travel time is short and it avoids the exhaustion of the island trip.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with everyone. The Hot Spring Town's set rate is exactly what I was hoping for to avoid any surprises with the final bill.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we have reached a natural consensus. Does anyone have any final reservations, or are we all ready to cast our votes for the Hot Spring Town?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I have no reservations at all. It feels like a choice that respects everyone's wishes and ensures a peaceful trip for us all.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,I'm ready to vote for the Hot Spring Town. I think I can handle the room if it means we all have a relaxing time.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am also ready. It is the most logical choice to ensure we actually enjoy the holiday rather than just recovering from it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm ready as well. It's a relief to have a plan that feels fair and predictable for everyone.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,Then let's make it official. I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I vote for the Hot Spring Town as well.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
